IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROBE-OVERFLOW.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-BIG      PIC 9(4) VALUE 1234.
01  WS-NARROW   PIC 9(3).
01  WS-SAFE     PIC 9(3) VALUE 777.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE WS-BIG TO WS-NARROW
    DISPLAY "move " WS-NARROW
    COMPUTE WS-NARROW = WS-BIG
    DISPLAY "compute " WS-NARROW
    MOVE 900 TO WS-NARROW
    ADD 150 TO WS-NARROW
    DISPLAY "add " WS-NARROW
    MOVE 777 TO WS-NARROW
    COMPUTE WS-NARROW = WS-BIG
        ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "size-error-fired"
    END-COMPUTE
    DISPLAY "after-size-error " WS-NARROW
    STOP RUN.
